{"id":"gotcha-example-001","type":"gotcha","fact":"Example: Truthy check on numeric values fails for explicit zero - if (value) is false when value === 0.","recommendation":"Use !== undefined or !== null instead of truthy checks when the value could legitimately be 0 or empty string.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"coderabbit","reference":"PR review","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["javascript","type-coercion","validation"],"affectedFiles":["**/*.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"gotcha-001","type":"gotcha","fact":"When parallel worktree agents fork from the same base, each overwrites shared aggregation files (router.py) with only their own sub-router. The orchestrator must re-merge all sub-routers after every parallel agent merge.","recommendation":"After copying files from a parallel agent worktree, always check and re-merge router.py, conftest.py, and vitest.config.ts before running validation.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"WU-11/12 parallel execution merge conflict","date":"2026-02-28"}],"tags":["orchestration","parallel-agents","merge-conflict","router"],"affectedFiles":["backend/app/api/router.py"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"gotcha-002","type":"gotcha","fact":"Pydantic Settings() singleton loads at module import time when any router module is imported. If env vars are not set, importing backend/app/api/router.py triggers a ValidationError. Tests must set env vars via os.environ.setdefault() BEFORE any app.* import.","recommendation":"In backend/tests/conftest.py, add os.environ.setdefault() for DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, SECRET_KEY, ENCRYPTION_KEY, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY before importing pytest or any app module.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"WU-11/12 test infrastructure fix","date":"2026-02-28"}],"tags":["pydantic","settings","env-vars","testing","import-order"],"affectedFiles":["backend/tests/conftest.py","backend/app/config.py"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"gotcha-003","type":"gotcha","fact":"Each new frontend components/<feature>/ directory requires a corresponding entry in vitest.config.ts coverage include array. Without it, those files are excluded from coverage measurement and 100% threshold passes vacuously.","recommendation":"When adding a new component directory, always add 'src/components/<feature>/**/*.tsx' to the vitest.config.ts coverage.include array.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"WU-12 search and WU-14 knowledge coverage gap","date":"2026-02-28"}],"tags":["vitest","coverage","frontend","config"],"affectedFiles":["frontend/vitest.config.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
